Having lunch at a different place?

326
23:04.880 --> 23:05.690
No.

327
23:05.710 --> 23:06.750
A different place

328
23:06.770 --> 23:07.840
for enjoying my spouse.

329
23:09.480 --> 23:09.890
Ow...

330
23:16.360 --> 23:18.510
I...I think we should dig in.

331
23:19.020 --> 23:20.340
Sarm, take a seat.

332
23:20.360 --> 23:21.220
Okay.

333
23:21.330 --> 23:22.490
Sure thing.

334
23:25.330 --> 23:26.330
Thank you.

335
23:35.580 --> 23:38.930
I have a meeting with Ms. Vibhavadi at noon.

336
23:45.010 --> 23:46.930
You never have time for me.

337
23:49.080 --> 23:51.100
Oh, Sarm...

338
23:51.130 --> 23:52.740
It is not like that.

339
23:53.020 --> 23:53.650
I mean,

340
23:54.130 --> 23:56.410
you should try the stew.

341
23:56.490 --> 23:58.330
I made it myself.

342
23:58.470 --> 24:00.530
Whoa, five-spice stew with braised pork.

343
24:00.550 --> 24:02.120
Really? You made it yourself?

344
24:02.300 --> 24:03.630
Oh, is there a yogurt drink?

345
24:03.650 --> 24:04.900
Do we have any?

346
24:07.230 --> 24:08.490
You do not get to to have it today.

347
24:08.600 --> 24:10.490
Your sugar intake is already too high.

348
24:11.360 --> 24:12.360
Fine...

349
24:12.920 --> 24:14.420
Whatever my spouse says.

350
24:15.130 --> 24:16.130
Good boy.

351
24:17.100 --> 24:18.550
Your cheeks are way sweeter anyway.

352
24:20.500 --> 24:21.250
One more time.

353
24:24.830 --> 24:25.830
One more...

354
24:27.750 --> 24:29.920
By the way, my fists

355
24:30.810 --> 24:32.430
are second to none.

356
24:32.450 --> 24:33.740
Oh...

357
24:33.760 --> 24:34.760
Want some?

358
24:39.430 --> 24:40.430
I prefer this.

359
24:40.930 --> 24:42.210
It doesn't hurt either.

360
24:49.130 --> 24:51.050
We might as well skip this meal.

361
24:53.490 --> 24:54.490
Just a little more.

362
24:56.940 --> 24:58.930
We are in a dining room,

363
24:59.310 --> 25:00.650
not a battlefield.

364
25:01.020 --> 25:02.370
But with you,

365
25:02.630 --> 25:03.630
wherever you are,

366
25:03.650 --> 25:05.200
it's a "battlefield of love."

367
25:08.230 --> 25:10.270
Did you come up with that yourself

368
25:10.290 --> 25:12.140
or did you take it from a series?

369
25:12.270 --> 25:13.120
I came up with it myself.

370
25:13.750 --> 25:14.440
That's because

371
25:14.460 --> 25:15.920
the inspiration behind that phrase is you.

372
25:25.970 --> 25:26.970
- Let me have you one more time. - Whoa...

373
25:29.250 --> 25:30.000
Oh!

374
25:30.220 --> 25:31.750
The food is getting cold at this point.

375
25:31.770 --> 25:32.330
Huh?

376
25:32.350 --> 25:33.740
- We can eat it later if we want to. - At this point...

377
25:49.890 --> 25:50.890
Hey.

378
25:51.410 --> 25:52.720
Don't overwork yourself, okay?

379
25:53.110 --> 25:54.640
Call me if you're tired.

380
25:54.770 --> 25:55.830
Understood?

381
25:56.470 --> 25:57.550
Right.

382
25:57.580 --> 26:00.600
I have my personal consultant.

383
26:00.620 --> 26:01.750
Of course.

384
26:02.000 --> 26:03.000
It's me,

385
26:03.020 --> 26:04.380
the spouse of the year,

386
26:05.110 --> 26:05.750
right?

387
26:06.190 --> 26:08.230
You are claiming the title yourself, are you not?

388
26:18.230 --> 26:18.840
Hey.

389
26:30.530 --> 26:31.530
Thank you

390
26:32.680 --> 26:34.240
for moving in with me completely.

391
26:36.830 --> 26:39.450
Your house is also mine.

392
26:41.240 --> 26:42.130
Bye-bye.

393
26:43.530 --> 26:44.450
Kiss, kiss.

394
26:45.630 --> 26:46.630
I will be going now.

395
26:46.930 --> 26:48.020
- Bye-bye. - Bye-bye.

396
26:49.240 --> 26:50.710
- Bye-bye. - Bye-bye.

397
26:54.430 --> 26:55.050
Little Jam,

398
26:58.730 --> 26:59.500
I love you.

399
27:01.710 --> 27:03.340
- I love you, too. - Bye-bye.

400
27:03.730 --> 27:04.560
Bye-bye.

401
27:04.580 --> 27:05.810
Do miss me, okay?

402
27:06.220 --> 27:07.730
All the time.

403
27:09.690 --> 27:10.910
Here's a kiss.

404
27:10.940 --> 27:11.540
Mwah, mwah.

405
27:13.140 --> 27:14.140
Mwah, mwah.

406
27:16.100 --> 27:17.100
Love you.

407
27:18.050 --> 27:18.880
Alright.

408
27:32.670 --> 27:33.610
I'm going to kiss a puppy,

409
27:33.630 --> 27:34.530
a kitten,

410
27:34.550 --> 27:35.240
and even a starfish.

411
27:35.260 --> 27:36.010
Mwah, mwah.

412
27:36.030 --> 27:38.300
♫Kiss, kiss, kiss, kiss, kiss♫

413
27:38.320 --> 27:40.120
♫This kiss is for you♫

414
27:40.140 --> 27:42.620
♫Ju Bu Ju Bu Ju Bu Jub♫

415
28:04.730 --> 28:06.210
Ow, this is killing me.

416
28:12.450 --> 28:13.340
Alright...

417
28:13.630 --> 28:14.630
Come here.

418
28:14.650 --> 28:16.230
Take a seat, Jam.

419
28:17.020 --> 28:17.920
I'll give you a massage.

420
28:25.860 --> 28:27.450
Where are you feeling sore?

421
28:29.830 --> 28:30.830
Here.

422
28:32.220 --> 28:33.040
Here?

423
28:41.030 --> 28:42.340
So good...

424
28:48.050 --> 28:49.520
Actually,

425
28:49.690 --> 28:51.820
hugging you already makes me feel better.

426
28:52.050 --> 28:53.050
Oh...

427
28:54.670 --> 28:56.930
So are you tired or feeling sore?

428
29:00.280 --> 29:01.760
I want my spouse

429
29:01.780 --> 29:03.320
to live comfortably.

430
29:06.280 --> 29:08.820
I actually want you to take it easy on your work.

431
29:10.490 --> 29:13.160
I do not like being unoccupied.

432
29:16.740 --> 29:17.740
If so,

433
29:18.410 --> 29:20.360
we should have an eye-to-eye conversation.

434
29:23.430 --> 29:25.630
Can we instead change it to

435
29:26.190 --> 29:28.130
a your-hand-on-my-shoulder conversation?

436
29:29.420 --> 29:30.370
Oh,

437
29:30.390 --> 29:31.480
you want your body to feel good, no?

438
29:33.220 --> 29:34.210
Oh...

439
29:35.610 --> 29:37.840
Of course, it is you who are giving me the massage.

440
29:41.530 --> 29:42.830
I'm serious, though.

441
29:45.540 --> 29:46.840
Maybe you have...

442
29:46.870 --> 29:47.950
actually been overworking.

443
29:49.130 --> 29:52.020
But things are going well.

444
29:56.640 --> 29:57.640
If that's the case,

445
29:58.070 --> 29:59.070
how about this?

446
30:00.160 --> 30:01.410
On weekdays,

447
30:01.830 --> 30:03.520
work as much as you like,

448
30:03.850 --> 30:05.130
but on the weekends,

449
30:05.600 --> 30:07.430
consider spending time with your family.

450
30:10.620 --> 30:11.580
Would it be a good idea?

451
30:12.620 --> 30:13.720
Of course.

452
30:14.410 --> 30:17.600
Do you know that your extremely adorable,

453
30:17.730 --> 30:18.590
handsome,

454
30:18.620 --> 30:19.930
and perfect spouse

455
30:21.560 --> 30:23.150
is waiting to do activities together?

456
30:31.020 --> 30:32.650
What activities?

457
30:32.830 --> 30:36.000
I have already tried all of the rides at Adisuan Farm.

458
30:36.250 --> 30:37.250
Oh.

459
30:37.320 --> 30:38.860
I've got so many games for you to play,

460
30:38.960 --> 30:40.340
like

461
30:40.530 --> 30:41.530
waking up a big worm,

462
30:42.520 --> 30:43.690
milking a so-called cow,

463
30:43.990 --> 30:44.930
or,

464
30:45.590 --> 30:46.880
kneading some bouncy buns.

465
30:48.150 --> 30:49.940
I've still got so much more.

466
30:51.770 --> 30:53.060
You're too obsessed, Sarm.

467
30:53.270 --> 30:54.090
What?

468
30:54.240 --> 30:56.120
I just want to have you. That's all.

469
30:56.270 --> 30:56.860
I want to have you

470
30:56.940 --> 30:59.140
day and night.

471
31:02.370 --> 31:05.290
We were just hugging each other to sleep last night.

472
31:05.340 --> 31:06.190
Mm.

473
31:07.210 --> 31:08.720
Last night is now a past.

474
31:08.740 --> 31:10.030
What matters is tonight.

475
31:16.670 --> 31:17.740
I think...

476
31:19.280 --> 31:21.430
we should save our hugs for tomorrow morning

477
31:22.460 --> 31:24.250
before heading to work.

478
31:24.730 --> 31:25.900
It feels exciting that way.

479
31:27.880 --> 31:28.810
If that's the case,

480
31:30.120 --> 31:31.690
can I kiss you right now

481
31:31.950 --> 31:33.030
at least one time?

482
31:34.670 --> 31:35.670
Please?

483
32:19.020 --> 32:20.020
Shall we hit the shower?

484
32:25.500 --> 32:27.420
Do you want to shower first

485
32:28.420 --> 32:30.550
or should I go first?

486
32:31.030 --> 32:32.640
You're supposed to ask

487
32:32.930 --> 32:35.220
if we want to take a rain shower

488
32:35.240 --> 32:37.120
or take a warm bath.

489
32:37.330 --> 32:38.400
That should be the question.

490
32:38.550 --> 32:40.560
Who says I am going to shower with you?

491
32:40.700 --> 32:41.590
Come on, Little Jam.

492
32:41.610 --> 32:42.850
You are the only one imagining it.

493
32:43.770 --> 32:45.130
I'm telling you that right now.

494
32:45.530 --> 32:46.940
Sarm.

495
32:48.950 --> 32:51.320
Let me take care of you tonight,

496
32:51.630 --> 32:52.700
okay?

497
32:53.890 --> 32:54.640
Mm.

498
33:34.570 --> 33:36.030
Why are you staring at me so much?

499
33:36.730 --> 33:37.730
What?

500
33:38.340 --> 33:40.030
Why are you this adorable, then?

501
33:40.400 --> 33:41.760
Little Jam.

502
33:42.460 --> 33:44.250
Do you love me, though?

503
33:45.430 --> 33:46.350
I do.

504
33:47.550 --> 33:48.930
You're more than love to me.

505
33:52.270 --> 33:53.480
What about you?

506
33:53.530 --> 33:54.830
Do you love me?

507
34:07.260 --> 34:09.130
I also love you.

508
34:11.659 --> 34:12.659
I'm sorry?

509
34:12.739 --> 34:13.739
Didn't catch that.

510
34:14.530 --> 34:15.530
What did you say?

511
34:16.239 --> 34:18.760
I said, "I love you," alright?

512
34:18.780 --> 34:21.440
Oh, you're so sweet, my good boy.

513
34:22.440 --> 34:23.170
Listen.

514
34:23.190 --> 34:24.909
From this day onward,

515
34:25.219 --> 34:26.219
there won't be a day

516
34:26.239 --> 34:27.650
that I don't love you.

517
34:48.929 --> 34:50.060
How about a session before the shower?

518
36:56.470 --> 36:57.690
Sarm...

519
36:58.020 --> 36:59.020
Sarm...

520
38:25.740 --> 38:26.840
What are you watching?

521
38:27.540 --> 38:28.900
Sarm.

522
38:29.620 --> 38:32.040
Look at this YouTuber eating a durian.

523
38:32.320 --> 38:33.880
- It looks so tasty. - Whoa...

524
38:34.450 --> 38:35.840
You want a durian?

525
38:35.930 --> 38:37.130
Mm!

526
38:37.750 --> 38:40.540
I want it!

527
38:40.910 --> 38:42.050
If you do,

528
38:42.070 --> 38:43.350
what do you have to do first?

529
38:49.750 --> 38:50.520
Refreshing.

530
38:50.660 --> 38:51.430
Sure.

531
38:51.650 --> 38:52.650
I'll deliver.

532
38:56.430 --> 38:57.430
New and Jiew,

533
38:57.830 --> 38:59.250
durian!

534
39:00.460 --> 39:01.220
New and Jiew.

535
39:04.760 --> 39:06.290
Whoa...

536
39:07.780 --> 39:08.900
Thank you, New and Jiew.

537
39:09.040 --> 39:10.130
Oh...

538
39:10.760 --> 39:12.420
You are amazing, Sarm.

539
39:12.440 --> 39:13.210
Of course,

540
39:13.390 --> 39:15.810
there's nothing that your spouse cannot do.

541
39:16.140 --> 39:17.090
Let me just tell you that

542
39:17.110 --> 39:18.210
I can do everything

543
39:18.230 --> 39:19.520
under the sun.

544
39:22.370 --> 39:24.510
You are just too much!

545
39:26.350 --> 39:27.350
By the way...

546
39:28.420 --> 39:29.770
do you know how to open a durian?

547
39:30.640 --> 39:31.640
When it comes to this,

548
39:31.920 --> 39:32.830
don't worry.

549
39:33.600 --> 39:34.440
New and Jiew.

550
39:36.040 --> 39:36.960
Whoa...

551
39:39.280 --> 39:40.410
It won't take long.

552
39:41.040 --> 39:42.760
I cannot wait.

553
39:43.330 --> 39:44.330
New and Jiew.

554
39:46.650 --> 39:47.810
Thank you very much.

555
39:50.000 --> 39:51.430
Looks just as tasty as the one in the video.

556
39:51.450 --> 39:52.320
Of course.

557
39:52.340 --> 39:53.950
This durian has a great shape

558
39:53.970 --> 39:54.920
and a beautiful color

559
39:54.950 --> 39:56.050
and it is perfectly formed.

560
40:01.760 --> 40:02.820
Another bite?

561
40:03.130 --> 40:03.840
Mm.

562
40:07.180 --> 40:08.340
That's better.

563
40:08.980 --> 40:09.740
Is it sweet?

564
40:10.410 --> 40:11.330
Hm.

565
40:12.250 --> 40:13.830
It is so tasty.

566
40:14.530 --> 40:16.480
I want to have it every day.

567
40:16.860 --> 40:17.860
You can,

568
40:17.880 --> 40:19.440
but you have to exercise, too.

569
40:20.780 --> 40:22.430
Can I exercise later?

570
40:22.750 --> 40:23.840
I will do it later.

571
40:23.960 --> 40:24.830
Sure.

572
40:25.730 --> 40:26.610
However,

573
40:27.240 --> 40:28.630
I do feel like...

574
40:29.430 --> 40:30.940
I deserve a reward.

575
40:33.740 --> 40:36.120
What should be the reward?

576
40:37.590 --> 40:38.750
Anything will do.

577
40:43.200 --> 40:44.480
It's all fine by me.

578
40:47.330 --> 40:49.420
If you behave and be a good boy,

579
40:50.910 --> 40:53.730
I will consider it.

580
40:57.120 --> 40:58.430
Let it last all night, okay?

581
41:00.920 --> 41:03.050
Do not be the first to go out of breath, then.

582
41:05.770 --> 41:07.390
I won't.

583
41:12.810 --> 41:13.440
Let's go!

584
41:13.800 --> 41:14.410
Let us go!

585
41:20.010 --> 41:22.520
Days off spent together

586
41:23.230 --> 41:25.770
do not have to be extraordinary.

587
41:27.400 --> 41:29.020
Just durians,

588
41:29.420 --> 41:31.010
laughter,

589
41:35.530 --> 41:37.930
and somebody by my side are simply enough.

590
41:48.330 --> 41:50.150
I feel so relaxed.

591
41:51.530 --> 41:52.530
Of course.

592
41:57.530 --> 41:59.050
I have a back pain, too.

593
42:01.140 --> 42:02.220
See?

594
42:02.270 --> 42:03.390
All you do is work.

595
42:03.410 --> 42:04.820
You never exercise.

596
42:06.420 --> 42:07.710
How much does it hurt?

597
42:09.560 --> 42:10.810
Not much.

598
42:10.900 --> 42:14.030
But it feels a bit uncomfortable.

599
42:15.040 --> 42:16.040
Right here.

600
42:17.660 --> 42:18.490
Well then,

601
42:19.640 --> 42:21.620
I'll take you to the doctor tomorrow.

602
42:22.420 --> 42:23.730
Do not flake out.

603
42:23.930 --> 42:24.630
Mm.

604
42:25.140 --> 42:26.140
I will not.

605
42:26.830 --> 42:28.110
Good boy.

606
42:28.130 --> 42:28.970
Once we're done,

607
42:29.120 --> 42:30.750
I'll take you to a yoga class

608
42:30.850 --> 42:31.920
and a pilates class.

609
42:32.330 --> 42:33.910
They're good for you.

610
42:34.530 --> 42:35.410
So do not complain, okay?

611
42:38.860 --> 42:40.320
At this moment,

612
42:40.490 --> 42:42.210
anything goes for me.

613
42:46.240 --> 42:47.240
Okay.

614
42:56.560 --> 42:57.560
If so,

615
43:01.100 --> 43:02.440
Let's warm up, shall we?

616
43:04.640 --> 43:05.750
Warm up?

617
43:07.940 --> 43:09.270
How exactly?

618
43:11.400 --> 43:13.300
It's to get our blood pumping.

619
43:13.610 --> 43:15.250
Then, our muscles will relax.

620
43:15.340 --> 43:17.230
They'll be refreshed and firm.

621
43:21.130 --> 43:22.130
You always

622
43:22.840 --> 43:25.830
find ways to come back to this topic.

623
43:28.170 --> 43:29.940
I want to take care of my spouse, alright?

624
43:30.100 --> 43:30.590
Please.

625
43:31.200 --> 43:31.760
Please.

626
43:33.200 --> 43:33.850
Please.

627
43:37.550 --> 43:38.550
Are you sure?

628
43:58.490 --> 44:00.230
Tonight, I'll do my best to follow your lead.

629
44:29.130 --> 44:30.520
Doing this kind of workout every night

630
44:31.120 --> 44:32.010
will surely

631
44:32.530 --> 44:34.030
get rid of your back pain.

632
44:35.120 --> 44:36.640
Sarm.

633
44:38.660 --> 44:40.220
Though you're always thirsty,

634
44:41.320 --> 44:43.030
you always treat me so well.

635
44:44.420 --> 44:45.780
My spouse needs to be healthy

636
44:46.350 --> 44:47.750
so that we can be together forever.

637
46:03.110 --> 46:04.160
Sarm.

638
46:04.180 --> 46:04.890
Huh?

639
46:07.900 --> 46:09.860
Let me do it.

640
49:31.100 --> 49:32.020
Sarm...

641
50:04.470 --> 50:06.240
Babe.

642
50:09.190 --> 50:11.830
Someone was trying to flirt with me today.

643
50:12.060 --> 50:13.270
It's that guy

644
50:14.000 --> 50:15.580
dressed up as a caveman spirit.

645
50:16.440 --> 50:17.280
While I'm away,

646
50:17.820 --> 50:19.480
do not wander off on your own, okay?

647
50:19.800 --> 50:21.350
Miss him, don't you?

648
50:21.560 --> 50:22.970
I will tease you back.

649
50:23.400 --> 50:24.230
Do you know that

650
50:24.260 --> 50:25.120
a good spouse

651
50:25.140 --> 50:28.280
is the one who wears a fluffy tail?

652
50:28.720 --> 50:30.070
Sarm.

653
50:30.090 --> 50:31.450
Let us go.

654
50:31.470 --> 50:34.490
♫What is this? I've never realized♫

655
50:34.510 --> 50:37.460
♫That someone like you can make my heart race♫

656
50:37.500 --> 50:43.610
♫I just have to believe that that person is you♫

657
50:43.630 --> 50:47.000
♫How did someone I never really cared about♫

658
50:47.020 --> 50:49.910
♫Turned out this way?♫

659
50:49.930 --> 50:53.360
♫Never thought I'd fall for you,♫

660
50:53.380 --> 50:56.250
♫But I totally did♫

661
50:56.270 --> 50:59.520
♫Explain how♫

662
50:59.550 --> 51:02.560
♫You became someone who I trust♫

663
51:02.580 --> 51:07.660
♫I don't know what to do♫

664
51:07.690 --> 51:09.840
♫'Cause you always know what my heart would say♫

665
51:15.240 --> 51:18.370
♫Explain how♫

666
51:18.390 --> 51:21.530
♫You became someone who I trust♫

